  "accepted_contract_decisions": [
    "Public PID claims are durable and never reused within one VM; restart opens the original state and rejects missing, corrupt or foreign state. Restart does not restore the active command registry.",
    "Tags use deterministic lookup, reject active duplicates before execution and retain terminal records for 30 seconds.",
    "Explicit keepalive must be a positive whole-second value in 1..9223372036; missing or unparsable values use 90 seconds."
  ]
